{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_015pF8ukDn484LCoXSnGdzYY", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.cdamm.org/articles/skoptsy\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.newworldencyclopedia.org/entry/Skoptsy\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kondraty_Selivanov\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skoptsy\"}, {\"url\": \"https://src-h.slav.hokudai.ac.jp/sympo/94summer/chapter1.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://golden.com/wiki/Skoptsy-P4AW85Z\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.everybodywiki.com/Skoptsy\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kondraty_(name)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en-academic.com/dic.nsf/enwiki/174391\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:20:40.597Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Kondraty Selivanov knouted Skoptsy commemorate day of his punishment date", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_016ckhRdZ6KCMgYWzdLwHBH8", "content": [{"title": "The Skoptsy - CDAMM", "url": "https://www.cdamm.org/articles/skoptsy"}, {"title": "Skoptsy - New World Encyclopedia", "url": "https://www.newworldencyclopedia.org/entry/Skoptsy"}, {"title": "Kondraty Selivanov", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kondraty_Selivanov"}, {"title": "Skoptsy", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skoptsy"}, {"title": "Self-Castrators in the Civic Discourse of Late Tsarist Russia", "url": "https://src-h.slav.hokudai.ac.jp/sympo/94summer/chapter1.pdf"}, {"title": "Skoptsy - Overview & Profile", "url": "https://golden.com/wiki/Skoptsy-P4AW85Z"}, {"title": "Skoptsy - EverybodyWiki Bios & Wiki", "url": "https://en.everybodywiki.com/Skoptsy"}, {"title": "Kondraty (name)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kondraty_(name)"}, {"title": "Skoptsy", "url": "https://en-academic.com/dic.nsf/enwiki/174391"}]}, "The date was **15 September**. One source says the Skoptsy practiced radienie (their ritual gatherings) on that day, and it commemorated the punishment Selivanov suffered for his religious activities. Radienie was practised, among other occasions, at Easter and Pentecost, as well as on 15 September, which commemorated the punishment of Kondraty Selivanov for his religious activities.\n\nA second source gives the same date and adds that the sect celebrated these days with festivities. It describes the date as the day of Selivanov's punishment and notes that on such days, they also arranged rejoicings.\n\nThe knouting itself is described in Selivanov's own account, which covers his capture and subjection to the knout, and experience of Siberian exile. That account became the sect's principal sacred text.\n\nSources here do not clearly say whether 15 September is an Old Style (Julian) date. That matters for conversion to the modern calendar, and I did not verify it."], "durationSeconds": 6.823685457999996, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_015pF8ukDn484LCoXSnGdzYY", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
